* Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy, “Decision Theory”, section on utility representation.
* Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy, “Normative Theories of Rational Choice: Expected Utility”.
* von Neumann & Morgenstern, ''Theory of Games and Economic Behavior'' (1944).
